 "entries": [
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "onAreaChange 在组件因布局变化导致大小、位置变化后回调；translate、offset、markAnchor、scale、transform 引起的位置变化不触发它",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-universal-component-area-change-event.md，onAreaChange；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，CommonMethod.onAreaChange",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1 步",
   "fact": "onAreaChange 回调里的 Area.width、height 单位 vp；Area.position 是左上角在父组件坐标系中的位置，Area.globalPosition 是左上角在当前窗口坐标系中的位置",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-types.md，Area；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/units.d.ts，Area.globalPosition",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 2 步",
   "fact": "View.isShown() 只有在该视图和它所有祖先都是 VISIBLE、且已挂到视图根上时才返回 true",
   "source": "android.view.View#isShown",
   "kind": "安卓平台",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 2 步",
   "fact": "Preferences.putSync 只改内存中的 Preferences 对象，要调 flush 才把它写入文件",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/api/@ohos.data.preferences.d.ts，Preferences.putSync；鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/api/@ohos.data.preferences.d.ts，Preferences.flush",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 3 步",
   "fact": "@Prop 与父组件单向同步：父组件状态变量的变化同步给子组件；子组件对 @Prop 变量的本地修改不回传父组件，数据源再变化时会覆盖本地修改",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/ui/state-management/arkts-prop.md，@Prop装饰器：父子单向同步",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 3 步",
   "fact": "@Link 与父组件状态变量双向同步，任一方改变另一方随之更新",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/ui/state-management/arkts-link.md，装饰器使用规则说明",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  }
